id: pm-rust-lcap
title: Match oracle semantic lineage depth and unresolved ancestor handling
description: "Existing record_semantics output traverses all ancestors and includes an unresolved parent ID, whereas the pinned oracle sdk/context/semantic-session-attribution.js caps resolveSemanticLineageIds at 16 and stops before recording an unresolved ancestor. The PR 77 round 1 indexing change deliberately preserves existing output; the new differential proves parity for a resolved depth-12 chain. Add separate deep and unresolved lineage differentials before changing the attribution contract."
